</main>
<footer>
  <div class="end">THANKS FOR VISITING MY CORNER OF THE INTERNET ♥</div>
  <p>© 2026 KHALED.EXE — Made with HTML &amp; nostalgia.</p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
